  "repo_truth": "The P4 child created only three exact fixture files, one named test, and one proof record. Parent replay: bounded selection/read/validate/intake subset is 2 passed. The exact mutation test fails deterministically before establishment with ArtifactMutationErrorV1 Store: generic lineage store refused: intake output tuple is not exact or unique. Live code derives schema_id-value from released coverage IDs while the lineage token grammar forbids underscores. No production code was edited. The claimed stop requires independent validation; P4 completion is not asserted.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Read-only replay of all 17 manifest entries and exact five-file P4 material subject.",
    "Independently validate the exact fixture/profile/descriptor/source fingerprints and successful selection, intake, retained-byte read, and schema validation proof.",
    "Independently reproduce and trace the mutation refusal from released coverage IDs through intake_commit_plan token derivation into valid_intake_value_token and validate_output_contract.",
    "Determine whether any in-selector fixture/test correction could make mutation valid without altering a released definition or production runtime.",
    "Assess proof-document accuracy, selector compliance, preservation of negative cases, and whether the stop is a genuine authority boundary.",
    "Identify findings independently before comparing P3/P4 candidates with 09."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No edits, formatting, staging, commit, push, handoff, ledger, dispatch, or delegation.",
    "No runtime fix, token normalization, token-grammar widening, released-definition edit, P3/P5/P6 work, or claim that P4 is complete.",
    "Do not rely on the implementation agent's conclusion; establish the stop independently."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Verify complete subject identity and inspect the exact five P4 additions.",
    "Replay the bounded green command and the exact failing mutation command.",
    "Trace the failure to exact live code and determine whether the required correction is outside the P4 selector.",
    "Validate that the partial proof states unavailable evidence honestly and does not promote Decision Record support.",
    "Return findings first in Critical, Required, Optional, Nit order with exact file/line, violated contract, why wrong, smallest remediation, and missing verification."
  ],
  "contracts_and_gates": [
    "Exact repository-selected Decision Record descriptor and definition closure",
    "Unchanged generic HCM-2.3 mutation/read/validate requirement",
    "No runtime or released-definition edit in P4",
    "Truthful partial proof and no unsupported classification promotion",
    "Independent P4 evidence"
  ],
  "stop_conditions": [
    "Return blocked if exact subject identity or required read-only evidence cannot be established.",
    "Report rather than repair any finding.",
    "Do not edit, delegate, create another dispatch, write a handoff, modify the ledger, stage, commit, or push."
  ],
